Description: Keep a KDE Plasma session awake for a set time.
 A tray icon that blocks sleep for 30 minutes, a few hours or until turned
 off, either letting the screen turn off or keeping it on too, and releases
 the block when the time runs out or the app exits. Can also ignore closing
 the lid while a block runs.

